version: 1.0.2
abstract: >-
  Code, frozen checkpoints and result evidence for DMU-NACI (Decoupled
  Mean-Uncertainty Learning with Normalized Adaptive Conformal Inference),
  a provenance-aware uncertainty forecasting framework for 15-minute-ahead
  PV power prediction on DKASC Alice Springs Sites 18 and 1B. The paper
  manuscript is in preparation for submission to Solar Energy; citation
  details will be updated upon publication.
keywords:
  - photovoltaic forecasting
  - conformal prediction
  - adaptive conformal inference
  - uncertainty quantification
  - residual provenance
